{"posts":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"6aba066c916f78f27020d319","text":"What a great week last week! \n\nI got to meet up with our Cloud Native friends both at our Trondheim and Bergen offices. \n\nSo nice to meet up with our colleagues around the country talking about platform engineering, sovereign cloud and AI. I love that we have our community across several cities, working on the same topics, working together to create great internal developer platforms for our customers, cloud architecture, cloud and ai strategy and much, much more.\n\nSo many smart people in one place.","status":"sent","dueAt":"2026-09-28T09:12:00.000Z","channelId":"681cb313556664dc1086cbca","externalLink":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:ugcPost:7510265145697136640","shareMode":"customScheduled","via":"buffer","assets":[{"thumbnail":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21fc1c5289835c1cb88/6aba062d6949e372203de21b","mimeType":"image/jpeg","source":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21fc1c5289835c1cb88/6aba062d6949e372203de21b"},{"thumbnail":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21fc1c5289835c1cb88/6aba062ecdc78b72d62c1279","mimeType":"image/jpeg","source":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21fc1c5289835c1cb88/6aba062ecdc78b72d62c1279"}],"metrics":[{"type":"reactions","name":"Reactions","value":5,"unit":"count"},{"type":"comments","name":"Comments","value":0,"unit":"count"},{"type":"engagementRate","name":"Eng. Rate","value":1.81,"unit":"percentage"},{"type":"impressions","name":"Impressions","value":277,"unit":"count"},{"type":"reach","name":"Reach","value":159,"unit":"count"}]}},{"node":{"id":"6aa934a0d32f8176ed4707ed","text":"Having a blast at Code Europe 2026. Meeting up with a lot of new and old friends, having great discussions and useful inputs. \n\nJust got of stage talking about how we implemented a Development Platform in a 200 year old business. Our lessons learned, choices, etc. It was a very engaged crowd, aski